      "text": "Vatumledor makes two claw Strikes and one tail Strike in any order."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Draconic Momentum",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When Vatumledor scores a critical hit with a Strike, he recharges Smoke Breath.",
